  "body": "Discover comfortable family living in the highly sought-after Mairangi Bay neighbourhood. Positioned within the desirable Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Murrays Bay School zones, this home offers a wonderful combination of practical living spaces, everyday convenience and an excellent coastal location.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across two levels, the ground floor features a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating an inviting setting for family gatherings and entertaining. An outdoor deck extends the living space, perfect for relaxing or spending time with friends. A ground-floor bedroom offers flexibility for guests, extended family or a home office, while a separate guest toilet, laundry and internal-access single garage add further convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three additional bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, including a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite. A family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, while an additional living area offers a versatile space for relaxing, studying or enjoying family time.\r\n\r\nZoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Murrays Bay School, the property is ideally positioned for families seeking access to well-regarded local schools, with all three located nearby.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of Mairangi Bay Village, local cafes, shops and the beautiful Mairangi Bay Beach, all within easy reach. Nearby shopping centres and convenient motorway access make everyday living and commuting across the North Shore straightforward.\r\n\r\nCombining a family-friendly layout, sought-after school zones and a desirable coastal location, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a private viewing or visit our upcoming open home.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Interior photos are virtual staging images for marketing purposes only and may not accurately represent the actual property.",
